  "system": {
    "identifier": "bakuton-explosion-release-chain-reaction-blitz",
    "description": "<p>You throw a string of chakra laced grenades into the air and use them as guiding lights for your assault. Select a number of creatures you can see, that you could reach with your movement speed as your throw a grenade at each of them. You then dash between each of them, striking the grenade in an attempt to blow each of them to smithereens.</p>\n<p>Make a melee Ninjutsu (or Taijutsu) attack against each chosen creature, dealing your [Unarmed Damage] +4d10 and forcing all creatures, excluding yourself, within 5 feet of the target to make a Dexterity saving throw, taking half the result on a failure or no damage on a success.</p>\n<p>If the original target(s) fail their saving throw, they don’t take half damage, but are instead Blinded, Deafened and Staggered until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>At the end of this jutsu’s casting, select a space adjacent to a hostile creature you attacked, and move there. This movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>",
